<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_951_2833.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear>, zuvor, from fürsichtig ersam
