<lb n="18"/>(als die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonsten</unclear> Ires <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theils</unclear>, unnd für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stim</unclear> inn die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestel</unclear>-
