<lb n="31"/>Im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">faal</unclear> aber sy über diß alles nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thhuonlicher</unclear> syn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beduch</unclear>-
