<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_951_2834.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="41"/>ten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muoßte</unclear> an unns (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> weniger wie üch ouch gsinnet
<lb n="42"/>syn wüßend) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nütjit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwinden</unclear>. Wolten wir üch
